quran[12]{c,v,t}:
  42,52,"Thus have We revealed to you the Spirit of Our command (i.e. the Qur’an). You did not know (before the revelation) what the Book was nor (the details of) the faith.* But We made it a Light by which We may guide whomever We wish among Our servants. And indeed, you guide (people)to the straight path."
  42,53,(This straight path is) the path of Allah to Whom belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. Beware! All matters will return to Allah alone.
  43,1,Ha-Mim.
  43,2,By the Manifest Book.
  43,3,We have made it a Qur’an in Arabic so perhaps you may understand.
  43,4,It is indeed (inscribed) with Us in the Original Source of the (Divine) Books. (It is) surely highly esteemed (and) rich in wisdom.
  43,5,Shall We withhold the Reminder from you altogether because you have been a transgressing lot?
  43,6,How many prophets did We send to the ancients?
  43,7,"Yet never a prophet came to them, but they used to mock him."
  43,8,"So, We destroyed those stronger than these (Meccans). And the example of (their) predecessors has passed before."
  43,9,"If you ask them: ‘Who created the heavens and the earth?’ They will surely say: ‘The All-Mighty, the All-Knowing (Lord) created them.’"
  43,10,"(He is) the One Who made the earth a cradle for you and set pathways in it for you so that you may be guided (to your destinations),"
